                          </figure>
                            </div>
                          <div class="right_subcontainer">
                          The <a href="https://www.math.cmu.edu/users/jcumming/irvine_set_theory_2026/">Conference on large cardinals, forcing, and related topics</a>
                            will take place on 7-10 February 2026 at the University of California, Irvine.
                          </div>

